Codex Harbor redistributes a mechanically extracted subset of data/models.json:
model IDs, context windows and reasoning controls. No Cherry Studio application
code, account configuration or private user data is included. The source hash
and extraction procedure are recorded in engine/cherry-catalog.json and
scripts/import_cherry_catalog.py. This notice applies to that package data only,
not to the Cherry Studio application's separate license.

